+## Bulk import
+
+`importTasks(list, text)` imports spreadsheet rows into a task list. Each non-blank row must be
+`title;priority;tags`, where priority is `low`, `normal`, or `high` (or empty for normal), and tags
+are separated by spaces. It returns the count imported plus each rejected row with its one-based line
+number and reason; a rejected row does not stop subsequent rows from being imported.
+
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
 
